Package: picompose-driver-satellite1
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 wireplumber
Provides: picompose-audio-driver
Conflicts: picompose-audio-driver
Replaces: picompose-audio-driver
Description: PiCompose audio setup for the Satellite1
 Audio setup for the Satellite1 of FutureProofHomes: it disables the ALSA
 card profile handling of WirePlumber for the sound card of the board.
 .
 The driver itself, the kernel and the packages of FutureProofHomes, is not
 part of this package, the PiCompose image installs it.
 .
 The package provides picompose-audio-driver, so only one audio driver package
 can be installed.
